{"n":54,"name":"Al-Qamar","nameAr":"القمر","meaning":"The Moon","ayahs":55,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":27,"ar":"ٱقْتَرَبَتِ ٱلسَّاعَةُ وَٱنشَقَّ ٱلْقَمَرُ","en":"The Hour has come near, and the moon has split [in two].","w":[{"ar":"ٱقْتَرَبَتِ","tr":"iq'tarabati","en":"Has come near","root":"قرب","lem":"اقْتَرَبَ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","tr":"l-sāʿatu","en":"the Hour","root":"سوع","lem":"ساعَة"},{"ar":"وَٱنشَقَّ","tr":"wa-inshaqqa","en":"and has split","root":"شقق","lem":"انشَقَّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَمَرُ","tr":"l-qamaru","en":"the moon","root":"قمر","lem":"قَمَر"}]},{"n":2,"juz":27,"ar":"وَإِن يَرَوْا۟ ءَايَةً يُعْرِضُوا۟ وَيَقُولُوا۟ سِحْرٌ مُّسْتَمِرٌّ","en":"And if they see a sign [i.e., miracle], they turn away and say, \"Passing magic.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"And if"},{"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","tr":"yaraw","en":"they see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"ءَايَةًۭ","tr":"āyatan","en":"a Sign","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"يُعْرِضُوا۟","tr":"yuʿ'riḍū","en":"they turn away","root":"عرض","lem":"أَعْرَضَ"},{"ar":"وَيَقُولُوا۟","tr":"wayaqūlū","en":"and say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"سِحْرٌۭ","tr":"siḥ'run","en":"Magic","root":"سحر","lem":"سِحْر"},{"ar":"مُّسْتَمِرٌّۭ","tr":"mus'tamirrun","en":"continuing","root":"مرر","lem":"مُسْتَمِرّ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":27,"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟ وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟ أَهْوَآءَهُمْ ۚ وَكُلُّ أَمْرٍ مُّسْتَقِرٌّ","en":"And they denied and followed their inclinations. But for every matter is a [time of] settlement.","w":[{"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","tr":"wakadhabū","en":"And they denied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","tr":"wa-ittabaʿū","en":"and followed","root":"تبع","lem":"اتَّبَعَ"},{"ar":"أَهْوَآءَهُمْ ۚ","tr":"ahwāahum","en":"their desires","root":"هوي","lem":"أَهْواء"},{"ar":"وَكُلُّ","tr":"wakullu","en":"but (for) every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"أَمْرٍۢ","tr":"amrin","en":"matter","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"مُّسْتَقِرٌّۭ","tr":"mus'taqirrun","en":"(will be a) settlem